  "title": "Sudan's Healthcare System on Brink of Collapse",
  "summary": "Médecins Sans Frontières warns that Sudan's healthcare system is on the brink of collapse due to severe funding cuts and a worsening humanitarian crisis. The organization estimates that over 100,000 people require medical aid, with nearly 30% of health facilities operating without proper services.",
